2026-09-27 12:46:03,362 | INFO | {"timestamp": "2026-09-27T12:46:03.362579", "session_id": "evaluation_session_2026", "user_query_sanitized": "What are the annual rental charges for a medium locker, and what fixed deposit is required?", "response_sanitized": "The annual rental charge for a medium locker (6\" x 8\" x 21\") is INR 4,500 + GST. \n\nAdditionally, the mandatory fixed deposit requirement for locker allocation is equivalent to 3 years' rent plus break-open charges, with a minimum of INR 15,000. \n\nIf you have any further questions or need assistance, feel free to ask!", "latency_seconds": 2.82, "tools_called": [], "risk_assessment": "LOW"}
2026-09-27 12:46:06,811 | INFO | {"timestamp": "2026-09-27T12:46:06.811188", "session_id": "evaluation_session_2026", "user_query_sanitized": "What are the interest rates for Fixed Deposits?", "response_sanitized": "The interest rates for Fixed Deposits (Term Deposits) at Apex Global Bank are as follows:\n\n- 7 days to 45 days: 3.50% per annum\n- 46 days to 179 days: 4.75% per annum\n- 180 days to 364 days: 5.75% per annum\n- 1 Year to less than 2 Years: 7.10% per annum (Special Apex Super Saver tenure: 444 Days at 7.40% per annum)\n- 2 Years to less than 3 Years: 7.00% per annum\n- 3 Years to 5 Years (Tax Saver 80C): 6.80% per annum\n- 5 Years to 10 Years: 6.50% per annum\n\nAdditionally, senior citizens receive an additional 0.50% per annum interest across all tenures above 1 year. If you have any further questions or need assistance, feel free to ask!", "latency_seconds": 3.449, "tools_called": [], "risk_assessment": "LOW"}
2026-09-27 12:46:09,562 | INFO | {"timestamp": "2026-09-27T12:46:09.562510", "session_id": "evaluation_session_2026", "user_query_sanitized": "What about senior citizens on the special 444 days tenure?", "response_sanitized": "For senior citizens opting for the special 444 days tenure Fixed Deposit at Apex Global Bank, the interest rate is 7.90% per annum. This includes an additional 0.50% per annum interest across all tenures above 1 year.\n\nIf you have any further questions or need assistance with anything else, feel free to ask!", "latency_seconds": 2.75, "tools_called": [], "risk_assessment": "LOW"}
